This folder is a copy of github.com/cloudsoda/go-smb2 at commit
0c5d69b69701 (pseudo-version v0.0.0-20260918041005-0c5d69b69701), which
Polyfin's go.mod replaces the module with. It is changed as follows:

- Pull request #64 of cloudsoda/go-smb2, "Implement SMB2 CHANGE_NOTIFY
  (File.Notify)", by forrestbao (commit 0da7f66), is merged in: the
  CHANGE_NOTIFY request and response in internal/smb2 (const.go,
  request.go, response.go), and notify.go, with File.Notify.
- notify.go adds, beyond that pull request:
  - File.NotifyContext, Notify bound to a context of its own rather than
    to the share the folder was opened from, so that a watch can stop
    while its handle can still be closed;
  - Share.OpenNotify, which opens a folder to watch with the right to list
    it only, sharing read, write and delete access, so that watching a
    folder does not keep others from renaming or deleting it.
- The library's tests, examples, test data, README and CI files are left
  out.
